criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Male or female subject aged \> 18 years;
* Subject living with type 1 diabetes (T1D) in the study arm, with a FibroScan examination scheduled during a day hospital (DH) visit;
* Subject living with type 2 diabetes (T2D) who has previously participated in the AngioSafe T2D cohort, in the control arm;
* Subject who verbally agrees to participate in the study (i.e., expresses no objection), after having been informed and given a reasonable period for consideration.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Subject with another chronic inflammatory disease (such as psoriasis, sarcoidosis, rheumatoid arthritis, inflammatory bowel disease, etc.);
* Subject with conditions affecting the immune system (cancer, hematological malignancies, HIV);
* Subject with an acute biological inflammatory syndrome (CRP \> 10 mg/L; leukocyte count \> 12 G/L) during the day hospital (DH) visit;
* Subject who has expressed opposition to participation in the study or to the reuse of their data.
